      description: 'Five ideas for off-screen play after Talk+: matching, animals, colours, music and stories to continue exploring together.',
      lead: '<strong>Off-screen play after Talk+</strong> can be as simple as spotting a colour in the room or inventing a story with toys. A digital activity may offer a starting point; objects, movement and shared play offer different experiences.',
      heading: 'How can you explore off-screen play after Talk+?',
