      steps: ['After Memory Match, find pairs of socks or available cards.', 'After exploring animals, hide a toy and invent clues or sounds.', 'After Colours, look for objects of one colour nearby.', 'After instruments in Play, make a rhythm with claps.', 'After Tell a Story, use toys or drawings to invent another ending.'],
