      faq: [['Must every app session be followed by an activity?', 'No. These are optional suggestions.'], ['Does this guarantee learning beyond the game?', 'No. Use in other contexts should be observed rather than assumed.'], ['Do adults need to buy materials?', 'No. Socks, paper, toys and available objects can work.'], ['Does the app replace playing with objects?', 'No. It can be one resource within a varied routine.']],
